{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The implementation now has a saved four-stage active flow—playing, returning, won/lost—and the timer’s loss check takes precedence at the dusk boundary. I also updated the existing full ordinary-input route so it proves lantern 12 does not win, the returning state survives a save/reload with its elapsed ticks, and walking back into the spawn radius completes the game."}}
